Scope of this licence

This licence covers the code written for this package: make_all_figures.m,
oif_config.m, setup_paths.m, the scripts in plot/, prep/ and tables/, the
files in lib/ that THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md does not list as third-party
components, and the author's script in upstream/.

Third-party components (cbrewer, the ColorBrewer colour schemes, inpaintn,
and the cmocean colour tables in lib/oif_cmocean.m) keep their own licences.
See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and the folder LICENSES/.

The data in data/, the tables tables/table_A1.csv and tables/table_A1.tex, and
the figures in figures/ are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International licence (LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt). Third-party data contained in
data/ remain under the terms of their providers (see README.md).
